            <keyword>bin center wavelength</keyword>
            <description>
               Single record table of values (comma-separated) for the center wavelength (in angstroms)
             of UVIS FUV data array bins over the entire mission. The values were obtained from 
             BAND_BIN_CENTER in the PDS3 calibration labels and have not been altered.
            </description>
